{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.206,18.17,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,14.953,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,15.359,1.643,1.471,"India Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.266,1.46,1.307,"11 November 2026"],[13.889,10.995,17.1,3.651,3.268,"Rentomojo"],[13.889,14.731,40.768,2.373,2.124,"Fast growth; the ‘normalised PAT’ is pre-tax"],[13.889,20.845,52.934,1.809,1.634,"Rentomojo’s Q2 FY27 results were strong: revenue rose 53% y/y to ₹142.1 cr"],[13.889,22.289,52.931,1.809,1.634,"on 1.05m live items (+44%), and profit before exceptional items and tax rose"],[13.889,23.733,52.934,1.809,1.634,"52% to ₹24.0 cr. The company calls that figure ‘normalised PAT’, but it is"],[13.889,25.177,52.934,1.809,1.634,"struck before tax. No current tax is paid while past losses last, and the ₹27.5 cr"],[13.889,26.621,52.931,1.809,1.634,"deferred tax asset left at September shelters only about ₹109 cr of profit, used up"],[13.889,28.065,52.964,1.809,1.634,"by mid-FY28E on our forecasts. Taxed at 25.5%, we forecast FY27E EPS of"],[13.889,29.509,51.113,1.809,1.634,"₹7.44; the shares, up 51% on the ₹404 September IPO price, trade at 82x that."],[13.889,31.995,52.931,1.809,1.634,"Three drivers. 1) Fleet: H1 added 198k items net against 217k in all of FY26; we"],[13.889,33.439,52.934,1.809,1.634,"assume 184k in H2, then 430k and 480k in FY28-29E. 2) Price: revenue per"],[13.889,34.883,52.966,1.809,1.634,"item (ARPI) grows 3-5% a year, occupancy holds at 85.5%. 3) Margin:"],[13.889,36.328,52.931,1.809,1.634,"normalised EBITDA has been 40-43% of income since FY24 (35% before lease"],[13.889,37.772,52.931,1.809,1.634,"accounting); we add 100bp by FY29E. Revenue grows 53%, 45% and 35% and"],[13.889,39.216,52.934,1.809,1.634,"EPS compounds at 47%. Growth is bought with capital: H1 capex of ₹192 cr"],[13.889,40.684,52.951,1.809,1.634,"was 1.75x operating cash flow, and we see net debt rising from ₹131 cr to c."],[13.889,42.128,12.48,1.809,1.634,"₹500 cr by FY29E."],[13.889,44.59,52.931,1.809,1.634,"That path is largely in the price. Our Dec-27 target of ₹680 applies 48x to"],[13.889,46.034,52.964,1.809,1.634,"twelve-month forward EPS, the midpoint of today’s 61x and the 35x median of"],[13.889,47.502,52.936,1.809,1.634,"five listed workspace and furniture peers; trailing EV/EBITDA is 33x against"],[13.889,48.946,52.931,1.809,1.634,"their 15x. An FCFE DCF (12% cost of equity, 5.5% terminal growth, 22% return"],[13.889,50.39,52.931,1.809,1.634,"on new equity) gives only ₹277, because growth above ROE absorbs cash. We"],[13.889,51.834,52.934,1.809,1.634,"rate the shares Neutral (ladder: −5% to +15%). Risks: credit and asset losses"],[13.889,53.278,52.987,1.809,1.634,"(3.2% of H1 revenue, before the ₹11.4 cr warehouse fire), share supply from"],[13.889,54.722,37.663,1.809,1.634,"pre-IPO funds (promoters own 19.7%) and funding costs."],[13.889,57.21,13.042,1.643,1.471,"Price Performance"],[15.268,66.579,1.489,1.022,0.915,"400"],[15.268,65.012,1.489,1.022,0.915,"450"],[15.268,63.446,1.489,1.022,0.915,"500"],[15.268,61.882,1.489,1.022,0.915,"550"],[15.268,60.315,1.489,1.022,0.915,"600"],[15.268,58.751,1.489,1.022,0.915,"650"],[17.147,67.273,2.96,1.022,0.915,"17 Sep"],[20.936,67.273,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Oct 26"],[31.475,67.273,2.96,1.022,0.915,"Nov 26"],[16.432,68.444,4.868,1.275,1.111,"Rentomojo ("],[21.303,68.47,0.618,1.241,1.111,"₹"],[21.916,68.444,0.303,1.275,1.111,")"],[25.0,68.444,10.689,1.275,1.111,"NIFTY 50 (rebased to IPO)"],[20.751,69.604,1.691,1.387,1.209,"IPO"],[24.701,69.604,2.635,1.387,1.209,"Day 1"],[30.462,69.604,1.433,1.387,1.209,"1m"],[35.09,69.604,1.323,1.387,1.209,"1w"],[15.277,70.67,1.691,1.387,1.209,"Abs"],[19.556,70.67,2.811,1.387,1.209,"51.2%"],[24.456,70.67,2.811,1.387,1.209,"14.3%"],[29.542,70.67,2.26,1.387,1.209,"3.5%"],[34.079,70.67,2.26,1.387,1.209,"3.6%"],[15.492,71.735,1.476,1.387,1.209,"Rel"],[19.556,71.735,2.811,1.387,1.209,"42.4%"],[25.007,71.735,2.26,1.387,1.209,"5.8%"],[29.205,71.735,2.597,1.387,1